Package: MONTAGE
Title: MONTAGE: A computational framework for spatially-resolved functional enrichment gradients in the tissue microenvironment via spatial communities
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person(given="Weiruo", 
           family="Zhang", 
           email="weiruo16@stanfod.edu", 
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: This package implements the computational framework MONTAGE. It has three parts. (1) Spatial community identification in single-cell resolution spatial omic data. (2) Create the MONTAGE signature matrix by integrating scRNAseq and single-cell spatial proteomics data. (3) Identify a sequence of spatial community composition changes along spatially-resolved gradient of a certain functional enrichment, aka, a montage.
